"steiner@math.bgsu.edu" <steiner@math.bgsu.edu> wrote:

> What is the best way to fight a killer bee?

You've gotten lots of good advice here. I'll just
add that if you have a wimpy weapon, then kicking
the bee might be superior. Not only might you do
better damage, but also sometimes the bee will
dodge your kick, and thus give you a path out of
danger.

A second point is that bees are very fast, and so
if you let yourself become burdened, and thus slow,
you are going to be bee fodder very soon.

One more; wands of sleep or slow monster can help
you kill or escape a bee. Take time to engrave-ID
wands, both those wands give hits of their behavior
when tested.

